  (text "wiper = clean + b (driven - clean)\nb = 0 clean only, 1 preamp only" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 129.54 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ccf136d4-b31e-50b7-9c4f-7b085caa80bf"))
  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 9. The Blend is documented [1]; its circuit is not public. RVX8, UX11: a linear crossfade\n(chosen), which gives the DSP's blend exactly. RX27, RX28: the preamp path's trim, drvTrim / g2 = 0.105 (chosen, set by\nmeasurement\nso that the preamp path matches the clean level at the defaults); their 0.9 kOhm source impedance bends the pot's law slightly." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c4f4edf7-88b5-5cac-b95d-d1d8ed65927c"))
